  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: badcc343379a2484387c7e828270c449, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dial_EN 5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dial
  scripts:
  - talker: 
    text: You finally escaped. Congratulations.
  - talker: 
    text: Well? Do these rooms still look unfamiliar to you?
  - talker: 
    text: That's right. These are the rooms that belonged to the original owners
      of the items you stole.
  - talker: 
    text: My room is among them, too.
  - talker: 
    text: You didn't just steal them. Think about how you got your hands on those
      items... and how you managed to never get caught.
  - talker: 
    text: You created even more victims just to cover up what you'd done. Those murdered
      souls have been bound to their stolen belongings, unable to escape for decades.
  - talker: 
    text: "Now that you've opened the Box of Truth, it's time for you to pay the
      price\u2014for every bit of time you stole from them."
